@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1) 查笔记列表
GET {{host}}/note/list

### 2) 查详情 id=1
GET {{host}}/note/detail/1

### 3) 查详情 id=999（不存在）
GET {{host}}/note/detail/999

### 4) 新增笔记
POST {{host}}/note/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "title": "通过接口插入的笔记",
  "content": "这是测试内容",
  "isPublic": 1
}

### 5) 删除 id=7
DELETE {{host}}/note/delete?id=7

### 6) 登录
POST {{host}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"123456"}